```Detection 4: Sudo to root (baseline of who escalates) | MITRE T1548.003 | Data: index=test sourcetype=linux_secure```
```Status: validated. 688 sudo-to-root events: djohnson 412, nsharpe 203, myuan 72, admin 1```
index=test sourcetype=linux_secure "sudo" "USER=root"
| rex field=_raw "sudo:\s+(?<sudo_user>\S+)"
| where sudo_user!="pam_unix(sudo:session):"
| stats count by sudo_user
| sort - count
